  </ul>

  <h2>What sets it apart</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><a href="/search/">Search</a>: one box for all accounts, about 30 ms on 200,000 messages, measured in the <a href="/benchmarks/">benchmarks</a>.</li>
    <li><a href="/privacy/">Privacy</a>: the app talks only to your mail servers, and every request it makes is listed.</li>
    <li><a href="/security/">Security</a>: mail and the search index are encrypted on disk.</li>
  </ul>

